ur security fundamentals are independently assessed rather than simply claimed. It is priced per user at a fixed monthly cost rather than bundled into rigid packages, so it scales with your team. Everything runs through the same UK service desk that handles your day-to-day tickets, so there is no separate team to chase."},{"k":"u5","type":"u","label":"Link: Back to Cyber Security","default":"/cyber-security/"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"Back to Cyber Security"},{"k":"i7","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-dark-web-monitoring-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-dark-web-monitoring-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-dark-web-monitoring-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-dark-web-monitoring-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Streams of green code and characters on a dark screen\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-dark-web-monitoring-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Cyber Security"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Dark Web Monitoring"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"What’s included"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Continuous monitoring of your domains"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Alerts on exposed credentials"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"Breach exposure reporting"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Guidance on response and resets"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Support for password and MFA hygiene"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Part of a layered security approach"}]}